    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside a busy Sapporo warehouse, Toshi oversees a delivery with distributor Furuya while Toru Muranishi looks on. After a sharp warning about fire safety gives way to polite business thanks, Toshi and Muranishi drive off—only to spot trouble ahead. Listen to how rough warehouse talk contrasts with Muranishi's polished manners.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よろしく頼むよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何で業者がタバコを吸ってるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "火事になったら全部弁償させるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "悪かったな、兄さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さん、頼むよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いつもお世話になってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "よく売れるわ。しばらくは稼げそうだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "それじゃあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "毎度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大丈夫なんですか？あんなこと言って。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "どうってことないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "パトカーだ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Toshi barks out blunt orders on the warehouse floor, while Muranishi sticks to textbook business etiquette. Let's unpack their key lines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よろしく頼むよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am counting on you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何で業者がタバコを吸ってるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is a contractor smoking here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "火事になったら全部弁償させるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a fire starts, I will make you pay for everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "悪かったな、兄さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My bad, young man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いつもお世話になってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you as always for looking after us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "しばらくは稼げそうだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looks like I can earn well for a while.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "それじゃあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, see you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "毎度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks as always.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大丈夫なんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it really okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
